<title>USA: Textron Inc says acquires Kaywood Products.</title>
<headline>Textron Inc says acquires Kaywood Products.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textron Inc said Monday today it acquired Kaywood Products Corp of Jackson, Michigan, makers of precision machined parts and components for assembled camshafts.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In 1996, Kaywood had revenues of $3.9 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be added to CWC Textron, a division of Textron Automotive Co.</p>
</text>
